{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261126/photo/bkn-20261126022539067-1126_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261126025146\"/><p>大老山隧道管道有3車相撞。</p><p>今日(26日)凌晨2時許，大老山隧道往沙田方向管道內有3車發生碰撞。意外中，至少3人受傷，暫未知需否送院治理。受事件影響，往沙田方向受阻。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T19:04:19.937418+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T18:25:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T19:17:45.191469+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T18:57:48.183269+00:00","content_hash":"2d28f8223ea7e0bb69deb1b3d3b1cf208a8280fffdae8f943772d5f9aeaf70a8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}